$ and $\\lambda =3.$\n\n**Note:** The eigenvalues of a triangular (or diagonal) matrix are the entries on the main diagonal."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186244109 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "633f0ebe-32ab-50f0-9e8f-09a9eb607c56" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$\\lambda =9$ (double root)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242073} {:answer/id #uuid "932a12c1-261e-51ee-80f5-7add48bc18c6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$\\lambda =2$ and $\\lambda =9$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242470} {:answer/id #uuid "93b1196c-0074-560f-86a8-6822a4095847" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$\\lambda =1$ and $\\lambda =18$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242475} {:answer/id #uuid "ba82803e-df0c-5ada-8931-ce4e8257ea9c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$\\lambda =0$ and $\\lambda =18$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242815} {:answer/id #uuid "ecad5c6a-34b1-50b3-8cd7-abb4cb6246a0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "There are no real eigenvalues" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186243273}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$\\lambda =0$ and $\\lambda =18$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242815} :answer-field/id #uuid "0818e6fa-35d7-5bee-9be7-dfa3e3d2be94" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186243454}] :question/id #uuid "f128d753-12d7-51df-b895-9c1460388388" :question/math-academy-id "q-107843" :question/problem "Find all real eigenvalues of the matrix\n$N=\\begin{bmatrix}18 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "Let's start by writing the matrix $N-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nN-\\lambda I=\\begin{bmatrix}18-\\lambda  & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0-\\lambda \\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nNow, let's find and solve the characteristic equation $det(N-\\lambda I)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(N-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ \\begin{vmatrix}18-\\lambda  & -5 \\\\ 0 & -\\lambda \\end{vmatrix} & =0 \\\\ (18-\\lambda )(-\\lambda )-0\\cdot (-5) & =0 \\\\ \\lambda (\\lambda -18) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the eigenvalues are $\\lambda =0$ and $\\lambda =18.$\n\n**Note:** The eigenvalues of a triangular (or diagonal) matrix are the entries on the main diagonal."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186345209 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "07c18ba8-2f85-5538-8a21-e05b01a9cbc5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$\\lambda =6$ (double root)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186342303} {:answer/id #uuid "86fafb2b-e442-5fe2-9441-ec8248f9fbed" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$\\lambda =-\\sqrt{7}$ (double root)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343402} {:answer/id #uuid "95bb5822-8bde-50dc-82e3-1e93d1a93f92" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$\\lambda =0$ and $\\lambda =-\\sqrt{7}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343547} {:answer/id #uuid "ba8eb93e-b23d-5c0a-89ef-b82668d2c181" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$\\lambda =0$ and $\\lambda =\\sqrt{7}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343875} {:answer/id #uuid "e8a2edc1-8426-5f26-bb8a-60658b2ce099" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "There are no real eigenvalues" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344276}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$\\lambda =0$ and $\\lambda =-\\sqrt{7}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343547} :answer-field/id #uuid "5d51ddfe-fecb-5298-be87-a83009b4126f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344648}] :question/id #uuid "2bc82201-7ba0-52f3-ae7d-a7d3c009ab95" :question/math-academy-id "q-76364" :question/problem "Find all real eigenvalues of the matrix\n$N=\\begin{bmatrix}-\\sqrt{7} & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "Let's start by writing the matrix $N-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nN-\\lambda I=\\begin{bmatrix}-\\sqrt{7}-\\lambda  & 6 \\\\ 0 & 