:answer/id #uuid "8688b5da-0cea-5d1e-9ba0-2678fa02cf28" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$\\lambda =7$ (double root)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186446674} {:answer/id #uuid "aa4c8e25-fb81-5e27-b673-2b99b02a167e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$\\lambda =-2$ (double root)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186446686} {:answer/id #uuid "ed046ba9-c6f5-5ba6-8016-8beac476dce8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "There are no real eigenvalues" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186446706}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$\\lambda =-2$ and $\\lambda =7$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186446656} :answer-field/id #uuid "bc20a709-7b8c-57c3-b33e-d46ed2185a69" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186446729}] :question/id #uuid "4f368600-216e-5acd-8869-df093ce09e0f" :question/math-academy-id "q-106996" :question/problem "Find all real eigenvalues of the matrix\n$C=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "Let's start by writing the matrix $C-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nC-\\lambda I=\\begin{bmatrix}7-\\lambda  & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2-\\lambda \\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nNow, let's find and solve the characteristic equation $det(C-\\lambda I)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(C-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ \\begin{vmatrix}7-\\lambda  & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2-\\lambda \\end{vmatrix} & =0 \\\\ (7-\\lambda )(-2-\\lambda )-0\\cdot 0 & =0 \\\\ (\\lambda -7)(\\lambda +2) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the eigenvalues are $\\lambda =7$ and $\\lambda =-2.$\n\n**Note:** The eigenvalues of a triangular (or diagonal) matrix are the entries on the main diagonal."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186446743 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5b663abe-8ca9-5e98-a421-8ee08f7f4b56" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "There are no real eigenvalues" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186446657} {:answer/id #uuid