iangular (or diagonal) matrix are the entries on the main diagonal."}] :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Eigenvalues of a Triangular/Diagonal Matrix"}] :topic/math-academy-id 990 :topic/title "Calculating the Eigenvalues of a 2x2 Matrix"}]}
